Begin Grant Account and Contact Access for {selenium_username}
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Access" charttab
	Click the "Access Control" link
	Type {selenium_username} into the input
	Click the "Go!" button
	Click the !Edit link
	Click the "Customize User Security" link
	Select Yes from the "Manage Accounts" dropdown
	Select Yes from the "Manage Contacts" dropdown
	Type "Manage Accounts and Contacts" into the sec_role_comment input
	Click the "Update Individual Security" button
Begin Add New Employee to Employer Organization
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Employer Organization" sidemenu entry
	Type Better into the input
	Click the Search button
	Click the "Better Corp" link
	Click the Employees charttab
	Click the "Add New Employee" link
	Type David into the "Last Name" field
	Type Dave into the "First Name" field
	Verify exists "!All Matching Charts:" text
	Type Ben into the "First Name" field
#	Verify !exists "All Matching Charts" text
	Enter "05-05-1985" into the birth_date date
	@Wait 10 seconds@driver.pause(10)
	Type "ben_david@mieweb.com" into the Email field
	Click the "Add New" button
	@Wait 10 seconds@driver.pause(10)
	Begin Verify Employee was Created
		Click the !Summary charttab
		Verify exists "David, Ben" text
	Begin Verify Employee portlets
		Begin "Select Portlets for Employee/Patient Chart"
			Click the "Select Portlets" link
			Select "No" from the "default" dropdown
			Select "3" from the "columns" dropdown
			Check the "Contacts" picklist checkbox
			Check the "Contacts" picklist checkbox
			Check the "Demographics" picklist checkbox
			Check the "Medical Contacts" picklist checkbox
			Check the "Quick Links" picklist checkbox
			Check the "Work Status" picklist checkbox
			Check the "Warnings & Alerts" picklist checkbox
			Click the "Save" button
	Begin Verify Employee is Linked to the EO
		@Wait for the section@driver.wcutils.waitForAJAX(30)
		Verify exists "Better Corp." text
		Click the "Better Corp.,  (Better Corp.)" link
		Click the Employees charttab
		Verify exists "Ben David" link
Begin Link Existing Provider to Provider Organization
	Click the "Overview (PO)" charttab
	Click the "Add New Provider" link
	Type David into the "Last Name" field
	Type Bert into the "First Name" field
	Begin Verify that the matching chart rows display
		Verify exists "!All Matching Charts:" text
		Verify exists "David, Bert" text
	@MIEDriver needs to be updated to support blur events@driver.reportCommandStatus('blurring is broken', '', None, '', '')
	@Blur the FirstName field by focusing the LastName field@driver.runJS("arguments[0].focus()", driver.getElement(id='last_name'))
	@Wait 2 seconds@driver.pause(2)
	Click the Link link
	Verify exists "Better Corp." contactcard
Begin Add New Account to Employer Organization
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Employer Organizations" sidemenu entry
	Type Better into the input
	Click the Search button
	Click the "Better Corp" link
	Click the "Overview (EO)" charttab
	Click the "Add New Account" link
	Type DailyChecking123 into the Name field
	Type 100000 into the "Opening Balance" field
	Enter "05-05-2016" into the accounts_begin_date date
	Click the "Add New" button
	Verify exists "Better Corp" contactcard
